  (no_connect (at 124.76 127.54) (uuid e860fdfe-0c85-4452-b9dc-4363cf26c325))
  (no_connect (at 124.76 130.08) (uuid 29684873-44ee-4a9e-88c9-1d899509d9e2))
  (no_connect (at 124.76 132.62) (uuid 82e64aa0-a093-43d8-a9ac-756da11963b0))
  (no_connect (at 456.03 110.16) (uuid 3da47125-0c9a-49ef-bc9d-ada69fc8c5a1))
  (no_connect (at 483.97 94.92) (uuid 8cdfb2a7-98dd-4364-9d46-6980451a2231))
  (no_connect (at 130.16 352.54) (uuid c66c4abb-e10b-46c1-ad02-bb7cf5e19b70))
  (text "1. ВХОД (5-22 V соларен панел) -> MPPT ЗАРЯДНО BQ25798 (PROG 1S, 750 kHz, 2.2 uH)" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 90cab625-8a7a-45f6-bcb7-0c905f9ad4d3))
  (text "SS54: защита от обратна полярност и връщане към панела. D3 (SMBJ24A) пази VBUS до 25 V." (at 20 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c516cb80-e0c7-4181-a34e-9905c408b630))
  (text "PROG = 1S винаги (R1 4.7k): с 2S PROG BQ тръгва с VSYSMIN ~7 V. За LTO 2S MSPM0 записва VREG 5.6 V и чак тогава пуска CE." (at 20 177.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd8622a1-ca38-405d-b6d5-fab005c35c57))
  (text "~CE: R4 към 3V3M = без заряд, докато MSPM0 не го свали (PA11). TP2 (QON) към GND = излизане от ship режим." (at 20 181 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f9fb0fe0-9fa0-48ca-becc-a964b8d0f483))
  (text "2. SYS -> 3V3M (HT7533, 2.5 uA) за MSPM0 + J6 OUT (SYS през идеален диод Q5 + Q9/Q11)" (at 225 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 984120be-8ec8-47fc-930b-4928229d2d40))
  (text "Q5 (AO3401A): D към SYS, S към J6, тялото му е диодът SYS -> OUT; Q9/Q11 го отварят, докато OUT < SYS (~30-50 mV пад, ~7 uA)." (at 225 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fe41fd42-4c58-4090-871c-2dc41d0f1f54))
  (text "Товар със свое зарядно не може да върне ток в батерията. HT7533 храни само MSPM0 (SYS до 5.6 V при LTO)." (at 225 143.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c77100c0-b3a8-416e-be06-555839fa7b1e))
  (text "3. БАТЕРИЯ 1S Li-ion / LiFePO4 или 2S LTO: Ship FET (Q2 + JP3) -> J4 (BATT+, BM, BATT-)" (at 20 186 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fbff52d0-9547-4e1d-bb09-60a45f748f48))
  (text "Q2 (AO3400A): S към BAT, D към батерията; в ship режим спира разреждането (UVLO, SDRV). JP3 затворен = без ship FET." (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 359373de-89e5-4a1c-82e8-2f7c2af1f69a))
  (text "J4: 1S = BATT+ / BATT-, BM свободен. 2S LTO = BM е средната точка (балансиране)." (at 20 255.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e32f6569-089e-4c17-94a1-0f4022564be0))
  (text "4. BMS: Q3 HJ8205 (OD разряд / OC заряд) + шунт 20 mOhm + балансиране 2S" (at 330 186 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1a0dcd0b-b19d-4502-bd6f-b21499c3bd5f))
  (text "Q3 е в минуса: S1 = BATT- (клетката), S2 = BATT_S -> RS1 -> GND. OD (G1) вкл. по подразбиране (R18), OC (G2) вкл. щом има 3V3M (R20), MSPM0 го изключва." (at 330 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e9b70581-c746-4da3-b5c6-62650ce1b477))
  (text "Без DW01A: ток/късо пази MSPM0 (OPA0 PGA + COMP0 с DAC, 32 ns) и BATFET OCP на BQ25798." (at 330 275.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2ab71db2-9983-4587-8e02-a48c2845505f))
  (text "Шунт: + заряд, - разряд; R21-R24 изместват входовете с ~33 mV. Балансиране ~40 mA (100 Ohm, 0.18 W)." (at 330 279 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4d2a4658-40fc-4c69-acfb-f286f4b23ad2))
  (text "5. MSPM0L1306: BQ25798 master (I2C1), INA260 емулатор 0x41 (I2C0 -> J5), BMS, LED" (at 370 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d8b57852-4f35-4aa2-aaff-5de8f87ac233))
  (text "J5 pin 3 (3V3E) е захранването на репийтъра: тук не се ползва, pull-up резисторите са на репийтъра." (at 370 176 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 612dc30e-ae22-4826-83e5-a3414776ace6))
  (text "SWD: TP12 3V3M, TP13 GND, TP11 SWDIO, TP16 SWCLK в ред (стъпка 2.54), TP17 NRST отделно. J5 = I2C0 на PA10/PA11 (само 3.3 V шина), ~CE PA17, OC_G PA0 (open-drain), LED PA9, J7 EN PA4, BAL1 PA2, BAL2 PA3, OD PA26, CHEM PA23, VBAT PA24/A3, VBM PA21/A5. PA1 и PA22 (изход на OPA0) не се свързват." (at 370 179.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9dc1f984-da6e-467c-ad75-c416b186208e))
  (text "6. J7 U: TPS63070 buck-boost 3.3 V / 5.0 V (JP6), вкл. с JP5: - изкл. / 1-2 винаги / 2-3 от MSPM0" (at 20 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ba3c105d-5dd8-4ff6-9492-c5e4aa072cb2))
  (text "FB: R33/R34 = 3.3 V; VSEL високо свързва R35 паралелно на R34 = 5.0 V. EN, VSEL, PS/SYNC към VIN само през R30 10k (TI 11.1)." (at 20 402 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6d643a66-32a6-4a67-a228-c68f2c2ee8bd))
  (text "L2 1.5 uH + 3x22 uF (TI табл. 3). PS/SYNC високо = PFM при малък товар (~50 uA)." (at 20 405.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ac49d828-afea-465d-b84c-00b878baea90))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
